  "title": "Chicken Marsala Meatballs",
  "description": "In this gluten-free one-pot meal, chicken meatballs bound with almond flour are simmered in Marsala wine with mushrooms and shallots.",
  "authors": [
    "Cindy Anschutz Barbieri"
  ],
